===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|tréyes}}
From {{inh|en|enm|thre}}, {{m|enm|threo}}, {{m|enm|thrie}}, {{m|enm|thri}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þrī}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*þrīʀ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*þrīz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*tréyes}}. {{doublet|en|tres|trey}}.

Cognate with {{cog|de|drei}}, {{cog|sq|tre}}, {{cog|hy|երեք}}, {{cog|la|trēs}}, {{cog|lv|trīs}}, {{cog|lt|trỹs}}, {{cog|el|τρεῖς}}, {{cog|cu|трьѥ}}, and others.

